  "archive_id": "BW2-B68-P03",
  "title": "A Conjectural Unary-Theta Formula for the 6n+1-Section of 18-Colored Generalized Frobenius Partitions",
  "batch_label": "68",
  "kind": "conjecture-note",
  "original_status": "unresolved",
  "scope": "Unproved conjecture in (Z/16Z)[[q]]: for Andrews's 18-colored generalized Frobenius partition function, sum_{m>=0} cphi_18(6m+1) q^m is congruent to 4*f_2*f_3^2/(f_1*f_6), equivalently 4*sum_{k in Z} q^{k(3k-1)/2}. The Jacobi-triple-product equality of the two right-hand expressions and their absence of exponents 3 or 4 modulo 5 are proved; the left-to-right congruence is not proved. Exact supporting computation covers 0<=m<=504, with 0<=m<=99 used for discovery and 100<=m<=504 held out.",
  "gate_basis": "Current released terminal, manifest, PDF, TeX freeze, snapshot files, provenance and four audits agree.",
